# Live application data (roast records, profiles, user accounts).
# This project is deployed on PythonAnywhere with real beta-tester accounts,
# so these files must never be tracked in git: a future commit touching them
# would let `git pull` on the live server overwrite or merge-conflict with
# real user data. See DEPLOY.md's Data section.
data/roast_records.json
data/roast_profiles.json
data/users.json
